      "year": 2018,
      "abstract": "This chapter provides a broad overview of geological applications of remote sensing data. First, it reviews the accuracy aspects and the general strategy required for data selection, resolution requirements, data processing etc. Then, the chapter provides numerous examples of applications in various branches of geology – geomorphology, structure, lithological mapping, mineralogical identification, alteration mapping, mineral and oil exploration, groundwater and engineering geological studies, coal mine fire mapping, volcano monitoring, earthquake disaster investigations, soil erosion and environmental applications.",
